      "position": 2,
      "content": "UPPER DIVISION NOTE",
      "contentHtml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0ad06f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 3,
      "content": "In sections below where the student is directed to select courses and there is a note \"Only lower division courses listed,\" upper division courses are also available. See the University Catalog for the full listing of degree requirements.",
      "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">In sections below where the student is directed to select courses and there is a note \"Only lower division courses listed,\" upper division courses are also available. See the </span><a href=\"https://catalog.csuchico.edu/archive/2025-2026/colleges-departments/college-communication-education/recreation-hospitality-parks-management/recreation-hospitality-parks-management-bs/#eventmanagement\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">University Catalog</a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> for the full listing of degree requirements.</span></p>"
    },
    {
